    "summary": "When the opposing player's **[Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase)** reaches its **Battle-shock step**, each enemy unit within 12\" of any **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** model of yours must test for **Battle-shock** if it is a **PSYKER** unit or has dropped below its Starting Strength. A unit **Below Half-strength** instead subtracts 1 from that test this phase.\n\nSo every enemy **PSYKER** unit and every enemy unit missing models within 12\" tests, not only those **Below Half-strength**.",
